Z||000000||FieroPerformance||03-07-2001||06:29 PM||||I have a 1985 GT with a 5 spd. I have started to notice that at high speeds (4th gear and 5th) most cars can gain on me pretty easily. For example the other day I was doing somewhere between 90-105 and a civic was coming up on me pretty fast. I had it floored in 4th, and I am pretty sure that he told me he had been in 5th. A 97 firebird also gained on me pretty fast after 80. I am just wondering if anyone else has noticed this.<P>Thanks,<BR>-Charlie||||reg||4
