Z||000023||bpfiero||03-09-2001||09:39 AM||||hey guys,   well I used to have the same problem, I would bet most imports,worked ones too,  but only through about 1/4 way through third gear, got fed up w/losing after third, so when I blew my 2nd gear, I put in the 4:10 four cyl. tranny in, and haven't losted yet, except to a VW GTI Golf, but he was turbo. can't help that. I do have a lot of work done to the car as well. <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/cuz2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000024||lou_dias||03-09-2001||10:46 AM||||I don't know what you guys are complaining about.  My 3.4 blows the doors off anything. I have the getrag.  Raced a new Celica the other night and easily passed him at over 110mph.  My car accelerates steadily from 4000-5000 rpms like I reach my peak and stay there for 1000rpms.<P>mods:<BR>ported heads + intake and K&N, hollow cat, IRM dual exhaust. 3.4 injectors, 44psi fuel pressure regulator, ADS offroad superchip for 2.8, 1.52 Magnum roller rockers, Crane Compucam.  SI valves, Accel coil, Bosch 4-way platinum plugs.<P>Need:  velocity tube, bigger throttle body, aluminum flywheel||||reg||1
